      <title>No fluff, no hype: An Agentic Engineering Workflow</title>
      <link>https://abhirockzz.github.io/blog/linkedin/2026-07-05-agentic-engineering-workflow/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 05 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://abhirockzz.github.io/blog/linkedin/2026-07-05-agentic-engineering-workflow/</guid>
      <description>
        
        
