&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/@kunchenguid&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Kun Chen on YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
